 Block \n[R]: Teleport/Transportation \n[Left Control]: Run \n[Double Tapping any Movement Key]: Dash (Instantly makes you run) \n[MMB/L]: Lock/unlock your cursor. (Required for certain moves) \n[1-9]: Special Attacks (Will require Mana) \n[Q/E]: Change modes for certain characters. \n\nKeep up to date with changes, updates, and planned features. ","path":"/game/3198259055-soulshatters-test-place","slug":"3198259055-soulshatters-test-place","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/c5c2ee7b64b7734f96c574bc4c078d63f0af5058cb8e09274429ab95b9c4267e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-dcdd9494181051a57bc4c5cf0e34ae1a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":162988362,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-10-06T16:33:40.261Z","creator":{"name":"SenatorBunny","type":"User"},"script":{"count":7,"freeCount":7,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":4042427666,"name":"NEW BOSS!😈 Anime Fighting Simulator","desc":"The original place of Anime Fighting Simulator","path":"/game/4042427666-new-boss-anime-fighting-simulator","slug":"4042427666-new-boss-anime-fighting-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/2480bb3af2ce901924d01f1a508b034b103fd20761812fb9d355f8a484ac1f23.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-55dd58d2091c9daf20fbb6018b2bb995/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":1396446505,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2023-08-13T00:59:59.535Z","creator":{"name":"BlockZone","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":15,"freeCount":15,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":3}},{"id":3173458677,"name":"🎨 Draw It!","desc":"🎨 Try to guess what the artist is drawing! Once the artist chooses a word, players have to guess what the word is before the timer runs out.\n\n🛍️ Spend points on wallpapers and emoji reactions in the shop!\n❤️ Tip artists points by tapping the 🤣 button and adding a reaction!\n👑 Get the VIP Pass for a chat tag, extra time to draw, and more!\n\nRemember to follow the Roblox Community Guidelines when using the in-game chat 